Another source of data on remittances comes from the Household Income and Expenditure Surveys
(HIES).  The total amount of remittances received from overseas according to the 2004/05 and
2010 HIES are shown in T able A4.  The total for T uvalu declined slightly between the two surveys,
but even more notable is the difference between Funafuti and the Outer Islands in which remittances
to Funafuti increased and to the Outer Islands declined.

